# tasks_run_at_the_same_time
is! 'f(ms) := { sleep(ms / 1000); ms }; a = go f(1000); b = go f(1000); c = go f(1000); await a + await b + await c' 3000
is! 'f(ms) := { sleep(ms / 1000); ms }; job = go f(300); x = 0; once job finishes: x = 7; sleep(0.6s); x' 7
